#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:99
msgid "Audit Post SEO"
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:100
msgid "Analyzes a post for SEO issues and returns recommendations. Only what Google or accessibility guidelines ask for lowers the score; findings of our own judgement are marked as such. Also returns the post's structure as facts — outline, lists, tables, figures, opening — for you to judge: no AI provider publishes how it chooses what to cite, so the plugin scores none of it. Read markdown_url for the full content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:120
msgid "Scan SEO Issues"
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:121
msgid "Audits many posts, newest first, and lists the ones with issues, worst first, each with its issues in full (type, severity, source, message). Filter by content type, status and issue type. A scan reads at most max(500, limit × 20) posts: when next_offset is not null, call again with offset = next_offset to go on."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:134
msgid "Maximum posts to return (default: 50)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:140
msgid "Minimum issues to include in results (default: 1)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:145
msgid "Post type to scan, or \"any\" for every type with SEO fields (default: post)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:151
msgid "publish (default) or any: drafts, pending and scheduled posts too."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:156
msgid "Only posts with this issue type, such as missing_description, title_may_be_cut, orphan or featured_image_missing_alt."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:161
