msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:194
msgid "Update Post SEO"
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:195
msgid "Updates the SEO of a post, page or product; only the fields you send. The title is the full title in search results, printed as written: the site name is not added, so include it if you want it (\"Terms of use | Acme\"). Returns what the page now publishes, and `warnings` when a title or description may be cut in results (over 70 or 165 characters) or another page has the same one. Warnings never block the save."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:218
msgid "Custom SEO title, the full title as it should read in results. Empty string clears the value."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:222
msgid "Custom meta description. Empty string clears the value."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:226
msgid "True keeps the post out of search results, the sitemap and llms.txt; false lets search engines index it again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:231
msgid "Attachment ID of the image the post is shared with (Open Graph, X), or null to go back to its own image and then the site's."
msgstr ""

#: includes/tooling/class-thatseoagent-abilities.php:235
msgid "Primary term per taxonomy — the one breadcrumbs and article:section show — as taxonomy => term ID, or null to let the plugin choose. The term must be assigned to the post."
msgstr ""

